 $k$ by finding a point on the graph and substituting for $x$ and $y.$ The labeled point on the graph is $(0,6),$ so we substitute $x=0$ and $y=6$ into the function and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =k({4}^{x})+4 \\\\ 6 & =k({4}^{0})+4 \\\\ 6 & =k(1)+4 \\\\ 6 & =k+4 \\\\ 2 & =k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=2$ and $c=4.$" 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186513247 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186513264 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186513290 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186513294 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186513307 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1077 "selection" 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1078 #edb/ref 17592186513247 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513312 1079 #uuid "fc1ca72d-e381-5c0f-8923-f97c4581e57b" 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513313 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186087824.py" 13194139535536 17592186045443 true] [17592186513313 1169 #uuid "9fcb8d6f-e996-5bb7-a671-b20495799375" 13194139535536 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"0b5c202d-778c-54ae-8d55-90e556720eac" 17592186513243 "0e89a2c6-e229-5c7a-a726-905b5cd23de5" 17592186513244 "12f27fce-4ec9-5f8a-88af-4fdd992da959" 17592186513245 "148a8a03-6ce9-595e-999e-f4d0bb2820f2" 17592186513246 "171fa761-3a85-56d3-a74b-7bf0586d366e" 17592186513247 "1c02b8e8-173d-552f-97ad-3130b712022c" 17592186513248 "1e0a099d-02f9-581f-aebb-e109b774635d" 17592186513249 "201a36f2-6472-5952-908d-c1599bf04a01" 17592186513250 "205d2e74-e2d5-5e18-a26f-6b9a011d134a" 17592186513251 "233d6bb5-1ddb-5d78-a70c-c0bc5382721e" 17592186513252 "25df17d6-139d-5491-8411-10a887f973ab" 17592186513253 "26cc6cb6-a1ce-5514-97f6-65b44f1416c1" 17592186513254 "2b8005c7-3a74-5b35-a129-e